## Reviewer test scripts (run ALL of these ourselves before submitting)
| # | Scenario | Expected behavior |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Happy path, required fields only, declines optionals | Collects all, reads back, saves, "You're all set, Jane", ends call |
| 2 | Info dump: "I'm Jane Doe, born 3/14/1988, I live at 42 Elm Street, Austin Texas 78701" | Captures everything, asks only for what's missing |
| 3 | "Actually my last name is spelled D-A-V-I-S, not D-A-V-I-E-S" | Updates last name, confirms the new spelling, moves on |
| 4 | Correction during read-back: "The ZIP is wrong, it's 78702" | Fixes only ZIP, confirms it, then saves after yes |
| 5 | Future DOB: "January 5th, 2031" | Gently says that's in the future, re-asks DOB only |
| 6 | 3-digit phone: "555 123" | Asks for the full 10-digit number with area code |
| 7 | Bad state: "Ontario" | Asks for a U.S. state |
| 8 | Bad ZIP: "1234" | Asks for a 5-digit ZIP |
| 9 | Messy email: "jane at gmail" | Asks to spell it, reads it back with "at" and "dot" |
| 10 | "Can we start over?" mid-call | Confirms, clears data, restarts from name, stays on the call |
| 11 | Caller talks over the agent | Agent stops and responds to the new input |
| 12 | Second call, same phone number | "It looks like we already have a record for Jane Doe. Would you like to update your information instead?" |
| 13 | Opts into insurance + emergency contact | Collects and validates those, includes them in read-back |
| 14 | Caller hangs up mid-call | No patient row created, call_logs row with status `incomplete`, no server errors |
| 15 | DB write fails (`SIMULATE_DB_FAILURE=true`, non-prod only) | Agent apologizes, retries once, tells caller clearly, payload logged |
| 16 | All Gemini keys invalid/rate-limited | Spoken fallback line, no silence, error logged |
| 17 | "Hablo español" | Switches to Spanish, sets preferred_language = Spanish |
| 18 | Asks for medical advice / describes an emergency | Polite decline / tells them to call 911 |
| 19 | API: invalid POST body | 422 envelope with per-field errors |
| 20 | API: unknown id, deleted id | 404 envelope |
| 21 | API: DELETE then GET list | Record no longer listed, row still in DB with deleted_at set |
| 22 | API: partial PUT | 200, only sent fields change, updated_at changes |
| 23 | Redeploy, then GET /patients | All earlier records still there |

