## Bonus challenges
| Bonus | How we implement it | Effort | Order |
|---|---|---|---|
| Duplicate detection | `lookup_patient_by_phone` tool on normalized phone. Use Vapi caller ID to pre-fill the phone ("Is the number ending in 4567 the best one?"). Update flow via `update_patient`. Only reveal the name of the existing record. | ~20 min | 1 |
| Call transcript | Handle Vapi `end-of-call-report` webhook. Upsert `call_logs` (vapi_call_id, patient_id, transcript, summary, recording_url, ended_reason, status, collected_payload). Link to patient via the call id captured when `register_patient` runs. Expose `GET /patients/{id}/calls`. | ~20 min | 2 |
| Dashboard | `GET /dashboard`: one HTML page served by FastAPI. Table of patients, search by last name, click to view details + call transcripts. Vanilla JS fetch, no build step. | ~20 min | 3 |
| Automated tests | pytest + httpx AsyncClient: validators, all endpoints (happy + error paths, envelope shape), tool dispatcher, key pool rotation with mocked 429s. | ~25 min | 4 |
| Appointment scheduling | Mock slots (next 5 weekdays, 9am-4pm, 30 min, minus booked). Tools `get_available_slots`, `book_appointment`. `appointments` table with a partial unique index to block double booking. | ~25 min | 5 |
| Multi-language | Prompt rule to switch fully to Spanish. Transcriber set to multilingual, voice that supports Spanish. Set preferred_language. Test it on a real call before claiming it. | ~15 min, risky | 6 |

If a bonus is half-done, leave it out of the live path and list it under README "Next Steps".
